Japanese semantic neighbor rankings derive from Facebook Research's Japanese
fastText vectors (Common Crawl and Wikipedia), model revision
be286af953967df11e163522974fff118569f1fb, distributed under CC BY-SA 3.0.
Source: https://huggingface.co/facebook/fasttext-ja-vectors
